# Geometry is generated or fetched, never committed: ST's board models come back with
# Tools/fetch_st_cad.sh, the enclosure with Enclosure/enclosure.py. Keeping them out is
# what stops 55 MB of CAD from living in the history of a firmware repository.
Cad/
Stl/
Enclosure/*.step
Enclosure/*.stl
verify.log

# Syncthing markers, from sharing this folder with the Macbook
.stfolder/
.stversions/
.stignore
